    <description>DIR-869: Attempts to acquire a per-Quote submission mutex by inserting a RES_Discount_Submission_Mutex__c record whose Name is the Quote Id. The platform's built-in uniqueness on a Text Name field makes this race-proof - if another orchestration instance already holds the mutex for this Quote, this insert fails with DUPLICATE_VALUE and acquired is returned as false. Used by RES_Quote_Discount_DOA_Approval_Flow to guarantee only one instance proceeds into the approval steps, even when two near-simultaneous Quote saves both pass the entry criteria.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>RES Autolaunched Try Acquire Submission Mutex {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>RES Autolaunched Try Acquire Submission Mutex</label>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
